# Remote repository policy: keep the deployable webapp and its webapp tests.
# Local scraper/database/tool sources remain available for personal ZIP archives
# through zip_it.sh, but are intentionally not part of the webapp-only remote.
/*

# Root files required to run, test and document the webapp.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/DEPLOYMENT.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/comandi.txt
!/mifp
!/test_all.sh
!/pytest.ini
!/zip_it.sh

# CI/CD.
!/.github/
!/.github/**

# Webapp source. Nested MIFPAPP/CORE/.gitignore excludes secrets/runtime data.
!/MIFPAPP/
/MIFPAPP/*
!/MIFPAPP/CORE/
!/MIFPAPP/CORE/**

# Webapp tests only.
!/TESTS/
/TESTS/*
!/TESTS/__init__.py
!/TESTS/conftest.py
!/TESTS/webapp/
!/TESTS/webapp/**

/TESTS/_pycache_/
scrapers_/